.DS_Store

# Image derivatives live in GCS behind the CDN, not in the container. The
# build only needs src/generated/images.json — it reads dimensions, LQIPs and
# the derivative paths from the manifest and emits absolute CDN URLs, so
# shipping the files too would add ~165 MB to every push and node pull for
# bytes nginx would never serve.
#
# Keep public/brand: the logo SVGs are tiny and are referenced same-origin.
public/img/
